    Party --> PartyRole
    Location --> LocationRole
    PartyRole -. participates in .-> Booking
    LocationRole -. scopes .-> Leg
    Booking -. creates or reserves .-> Shipment
    Shipment -. books .-> Consignment
    Consignment --> Item
    Booking --> Request
    Shipment --> Allocation
    Allocation --> Asset
    Asset --> Journey
    Consignment --> Route
    Route --> Leg
    Leg -. realized by .-> Movement
    Movement --> Call
    Event -. concerns .-> Shipment
    Event -. concerns .-> Consignment
    Event -. concerns .-> Asset
    Event -. occurs at .-> Call
    Consignment -. evidenced by .-> Document
